    "text": "For the sea areas extending from Hambantota to Pottuvil. PLEASE BE PREPARED! The sea areas off the coasts extending from Hambantota to Pottuvil will be very rough at times with strong gusty winds up to (50-60) kmph. Naval and fishing communities are requested to be vigilant and be attentive to future forecasts issued by the Department of Meteorology in this regard.",
